; Example usage of the `local-forms` plugin. Each canvas exercises one
; resolution path of the `:shape` slot:
;   * a slot-local `circle` (shadows the global circle requiring :radius);
;   * a nested slot-local `group` → local `dot`;
;   * the additive global fallback to a top-level `line`.
(canvas :shape (circle :r 12))
(canvas :shape (group :child (dot)))
(canvas :shape (line :from [0 0] :to [10 10]))
